<title>POLAND: BIG MAY NET RISES TO PLN 3.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BIG MAY NET RISES TO PLN 3.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.80 vs    3.42</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.80 vs    3.42</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  9.18 vs    7.12</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	45.14 vs   32.08</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 29.83 vs   38.96</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   29.83 vs   38.96</p>
